	(text "GPIO0,A0   - LED D6  -> V5\nGPIO1/D1   - Valve 1\nGPIO2/D2   - Valve 2\nGPIO21/D3  - Valve 3\nGPIO19/D8  - Valve 4\nGPIO22/D4  - Valve 5 -> SDA\nGPIO23/D5  - Valve 6 -> SCL\nGPIO16/D6  - Valve 7\nGPIO17/D7  - Valve 8\nGPIO20/D9  - LED D1/D2 -> V6\nGPIO18/D10 - Water meter\nGPIO3      - /Antenna chip\nGPIO14     - H=ext antenna\nGPIO15     - Module yellow LED\n\nAvoid 4,5,8,9,15\n2 - 8 - 9 \n-   -   H   normal\n1   NA  1   SPI boot\n1   1   0   Download\n"
